{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/01/01/10956_crt_5LR7z.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/01/01/10956_crt_5LR7z.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/01/01/10956_crt_5LR7z.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/01/01/10956_crt_5LR7z.jpg"},"name":"ナレーション","summary":"戏剧角色背着台上其他剧中人对观众说的话。也指影视片中的解说词。说话者不出现在画面上，但直接以语言来介绍影片内容、交待剧情或发表议论，包括对白的使用。","relation":"旁白","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/d7/bd/93172_prsn_OWyQN.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/d7/bd/93172_prsn_OWyQN.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/d7/bd/93172_prsn_OWyQN.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/d7/bd/93172_prsn_OWyQN.jpg"},"name":"木下秀雄","short_summary":"日本の男性俳優、声優。東京府（現：東京都）出身。","career":["seiyu","actor"],"id":93172,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":10956},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/4d/d5/210962_crt_TQIeV.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/4d/d5/210962_crt_TQIeV.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/4d/d5/210962_crt_TQIeV.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/4d/d5/210962_crt_TQIeV.jpg"},"name":"ガッチャマン","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/14/8d/4291_seiyu_anidb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/14/8d/4291_seiyu_anidb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/14/8d/4291_seiyu_anidb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/14/8d/4291_seiyu_anidb.jpg"},"name":"森功至","short_summary":"日本の声優、俳優、ナレーター。中華民国浙江省（現：中華人民共和国浙江省）出生、東京都中央区日本橋、文京区大塚仲町（現：東京都文京区大塚）出身。プラスワンカンパニー所属。","career":["seiyu"],"id":4291,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":210962},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/23/4f/210964_crt_VEVVT.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/23/4f/210964_crt_VEVVT.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/23/4f/210964_crt_VEVVT.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/23/4f/210964_crt_VEVVT.jpg"},"name":"ジョー","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/6a/bb/4654_seiyu_anidb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/6a/bb/4654_seiyu_anidb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/6a/bb/4654_seiyu_anidb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/6a/bb/4654_seiyu_anidb.jpg"},"name":"ささきいさお","short_summary":"日本的歌手、演员、声优、剧情解说。东京都出身。本名以及旧艺名为佐々木功。音乐类型主要为ANISON，J-POP。著有《携子再婚的单程票》一书。\r\n\r\n在就读武藏高校时，就开始从事歌手的活动，在1960年以『本命就是你』做为Rockailly歌手出道作，被称为日本的猫王。之后以出演新剧与音乐剧为大宗，以演员工作做为主要的活动。\r\n\r\n1972年，以声优的身份出演龙之子制作公司制作的『科学小飞侠』的「大明」一角，翌年担任『新造人间凯翔』的主题曲演唱，从此成为动画歌手，演唱大量动画与特摄电视剧的主题曲。1974年时，因为演唱电视动画「宇宙战舰大和号」的主题曲而风靡一时，创造百万销售量的纪录。\r\n\r\n与大杉久美子、堀江美都子、水木一郎一起，支撑着动画歌曲的黎明期。\r\n与水木一郎、子门真人并称动画歌手三大男高音。\r\n\r\n作为动画歌手，有着动画歌手之王的称号。","career":["artist","seiyu"],"id":4654,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":210964},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/b7/e4/210965_crt_JuNiI.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/b7/e4/210965_crt_JuNiI.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b7/e4/210965_crt_JuNiI.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/b7/e4/210965_crt_JuNiI.jpg"},"name":"ジュン","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/1b/e8/3910_seiyu_anidb.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/1b/e8/3910_seiyu_anidb.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/1b/e8/3910_seiyu_anidb.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/1b/e8/3910_seiyu_anidb.jpg"},"name":"杉山佳寿子","short_summary":"杉山 佳寿子は、日本の声優、ナレーター、舞台女優、大阪芸術大学教授（放送学科声優コース）。本名は渋川 佳寿子（しぶかわ かずこ）。青二プロダクション所属。シンガーソングライター、俳優、声優の渋川チワワは息子。\r\n\r\n身長153センチ。愛称は、カコ。\r\n\r\n役柄は様々であり、ハイジやあかね等の少女の他、テン、コロ助、『ウメ星デンカ』のデンカ等、少年役も多い。少女役の中でも、元気娘から不良娘まで、広い系統をカバーしている。","career":["seiyu"],"id":3910,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":210965},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/71/c4/210966_crt_F9Y4l.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/71/c4/210966_crt_F9Y4l.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/71/c4/210966_crt_F9Y4l.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/71/c4/210966_crt_F9Y4l.jpg"},"name":"じん平","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/b0/e9/1452_prsn_8l82w.jpg?r=1723560181","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/b0/e9/1452_prsn_8l82w.jpg?r=1723560181","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b0/e9/1452_prsn_8l82w.jpg?r=1723560181","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/b0/e9/1452_prsn_8l82w.jpg?r=1723560181"},"name":"塩屋翼","short_summary":"8歳の時、子役としてデビュー。\r\n『劇団ひまわり』『青二プロダクション』を経て、14歳の頃より声優として活動。\r\n出演作品は3000本以上。\r\nその後、オムニバスプロモーションで音響監督として活躍、現在『サウンド・ウィング』所属の音響監督として数々の作品を手がけている。","career":["producer","seiyu"],"id":1452,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":210966},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/ea/ce/210967_crt_SW5Ue.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/ea/ce/210967_crt_SW5Ue.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ea/ce/210967_crt_SW5Ue.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/ea/ce/210967_crt_SW5Ue.jpg"},"name":"竜","summary":"","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/9b/b2/11241_prsn_4fbQe.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/9b/b2/11241_prsn_4fbQe.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/9b/b2/11241_prsn_4fbQe.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/9b/b2/11241_prsn_4fbQe.jpg"},"name":"兼本新吾","short_summary":"兴趣为柔道的老一辈男性声优，代表作为《巨人之星》中的左门豊作和《科学小飞侠》中的五号阿龙。","career":["seiyu"],"id":11241,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/a3/da/79222_prsn_33bbp.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/a3/da/79222_prsn_33bbp.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/a3/da/79222_prsn_33bbp.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/a3/da/79222_prsn_33bbp.jpg"},"name":"鐵孟秋","short_summary":"原名铁梦秋，台湾资深演员、配音员，1960年代活跃迄今。","career":["seiyu","actor"],"id":79222,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":210967},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.t